{
  "format": "rustsheet-case/v1",
  "description": "T-4626: text and text-number elements of MDETERM, MINVERSE and MMULT matrices. Data: A1 '5' and A2 'x' (text), B1:C2 {1,'2';3,4}, D1:E2 {1,'a';3,4}, F1:F2 {1;2}, G1:H1 {1,'2'}, G2:H2 {1,'a'}, K1:K2 {'3';4} (quoted values are text cells). M1-M7 MDETERM (literal, one-cell and range forms); M8-M17 MINVERSE (INDEX of the first element; M15 a direct text argument; M16-M17 SUM(IFERROR(..,100)) counts error elements); M18-M27 MMULT (M27 counts error elements of a 2x2 product with one text element); M28 an all-number control.",
